ation><Summary>Candidate Background</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the background elements as defined in the candidate template. For example:CandidateBackground_Certificate, CandidateBackground_Education, etc</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Candidate</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="EmployeeTimeGroupItem" EntityType="SFOData.EmployeeTimeGroupItem" sap:label="EmployeeTimeGroupItem" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>EmployeeTimeGroupItem</Summary><LongDescription>This entity is an item of an EmployeeTimeGroup. It stores a reference to an EmployeeTime.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="BenefitInsuranceCoverageOptions" EntityType="SFOData.BenefitInsuranceCoverageOptions" sap:label="Insurance Coverage Options" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>BenefitInsuranceCoverageOptions</Summary><LongDescription>Contains information about the Enrollee Options and the Insurance Coverages that would be applicable.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Global Benefits</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Form360ParticipantSection" EntityType="SFOData.Form360ParticipantSection" sap:label="Form360ParticipantSection" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Form360ParticipantSection</Summary><LongDescription>In order to show participant section, it contains participants and the configuration.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>MTR - MultiRater Review</sap:tag></sap:tagco