d with a job profile.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Suite (STE)</sap:tag><sap:tag>STE - Skills Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="LegalEntitySAU" EntityType="SFOData.LegalEntitySAU" sap:label="Legal Entity Saudi Arabia" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>LegalEntitySAU</Summary><LongDescription>This entity contains legal entities specific to SAU.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Foundation/Organization</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PaymentInformationDetailV3ARG" EntityType="SFOData.PaymentInformationDetailV3ARG" sap:label="Payment Information Detail ARG" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>PaymentInformationDetailV3ARG</Summary><LongDescription>Child object of PaymentInformationV3. Stores the country-dependent fields of payment information details for Argentina.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payment Information</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="BenefitCompanyCarAllowedModels" EntityType="SFOData.BenefitCompanyCarAllowedModels" sap:label="Benefit Company Car Allowed Models" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>BenefitCompanyCarAllowedModels</Summary><LongDescription>Contains information about differenc car models that can be selected from the drop-down list in the application.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Global Benefits</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="ExternalLearner" EntityType="SFOData.ExternalLearner" sap:label="ExternalLearner" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="false" sap:upserta