ation information for the requested advance and remaining eligibility for the user. It is not a effective dated entity in the Advances module. This entity is created when a advance is approved by the supervisor.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Advances</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FOFrequency" EntityType="SFOData.FOFrequency" sap:label="Frequency" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FOFrequency</Summary><LongDescription>This is a foundation object that describes how often an employee gets paid.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Foundation/Organization</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="EducationDegreeContent" EntityType="SFOData.EducationDegreeContent" sap:label="Degree Content" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>EducationDegreeContent</Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Suite (STE)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="GoalPlanState" EntityType="SFOData.GoalPlanState" sap:label="GoalPlanState" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Goal Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="BenefitPensionStatutoryMinimumLookup" EntityType="SFOData.BenefitPensionStatutoryMinimumLookup" sap:label="Benefit Pension Statutory Lookup" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>BenefitPensionStatutoryMinimumLookup</Summary><LongDescription>Contains the minimum amount/ percentage that an employer and employee is supposed to contribute towards pension as per the law.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Global Benefits</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="ExternalLearnerAddressInfo" EntityType="SFOData.ExternalLearnerAddressInfo" sap:label="Addresses" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false" sap:support-elm="true"><Documentation><Summary>ExternalLearnerAddressInfo</Summary><LongDescription>Address information of external learner, such as address type and country, state, city and address.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="RecalculationBasedField" EntityType="SFOData.RecalculationBasedField" sap:label="RecalculationBasedField" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>RecalculationBasedField</Summary><LongDescription>You can use recalculation based fields in a time account type to define for which job information fields a recalculation of accruals should be triggered.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="BenefitCompanyCar" EntityType="SFOData.BenefitCompanyCar" sap:label="Benefit Company Car" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>BenefitCompanyCar</Summary><LongDescription>Contains information about car lease service providers.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Global Benefits</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="DevGoalCompetency" EntityType="SFOData.DevGoalCompetency" sap:label="DevGoalCompetency" sap:creatable="false